WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.084 --> 00:00:13.427
Jane and Pip march with the Gummy Guards.

2
00:00:13.428 --> 00:00:21.742
Pip blinks. "Slime is taking over the land!"

3
00:00:21.743 --> 00:00:26.569
"We're not far from the duke," Paul says.

4
00:00:26.570 --> 00:00:31.457
Stinky waves rise and crash into the road.

5
00:00:31.458 --> 00:00:36.287
"Ahh!" Jane screams.

6
00:00:36.288 --> 00:00:40.797
Slime hands reach out for the kids.

7
00:00:40.798 --> 00:01:04.118
Gummy Guards beat the goo away.

8
00:01:04.119 --> 00:01:07.899
At last the army comes to the castle.

9
00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:12.098
"Give up!" a man yells from the gate.

10
00:01:12.099 --> 00:01:15.366
"Sweet Land is sweet no more!

11
00:01:15.367 --> 00:01:23.182
It's Slime Land now—and it's mine!"

12
00:01:23.183 --> 00:01:25.217
Pip darts out.

13
00:01:25.218 --> 00:01:28.378
"Pip!" Jane says. "Don't—"

14
00:01:28.380 --> 00:01:33.555
"You won't win, Duke!" Pip shouts.

15
00:01:33.556 --> 00:01:38.831
The duke grins. "Oh!

16
00:01:38.832 --> 00:01:44.999
It's the short prince and bossy princess!"

17
00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:48.624
Pip yanks the wand from Jane.

18
00:01:48.625 --> 00:01:50.927
He points it at the duke.

19
00:01:50.928 --> 00:02:02.631
"Pip! Stop!" Jane cries.

20
00:02:02.632 --> 00:02:08.141
The duke snorts. "What a bore.

21
00:02:08.142 --> 00:02:11.555
You can't use the wand or sweet magic.

22
00:02:11.556 --> 00:02:13.564
You won't stop me!

23
00:02:13.565 --> 00:02:19.082
You're just two kids who can't get along."

24
00:02:19.083 --> 00:02:21.985
He lifts his arms and sings.

25
00:02:21.986 --> 00:02:25.088
"Stinky goo and icky muck.

26
00:02:25.089 --> 00:02:38.845
Bring those kids to the Duke of Yuck!"

27
00:02:38.846 --> 00:02:48.758
The kids gulp as slime monsters rise up.

